OL,3,ASir Mel Stride replaced as shadow
OL,4,Achancellor as Conservatives reshuffle
OL,5,Atop team
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndrew Griffith has replaced Sir Mel
OL,8,FStride as shadow chancellor as part of
OL,9,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch's
OL,10,Freshuffle of her top team.
OL,12,FClaire Coutinho, previously the shadow
OL,13,Fenergy secretary, after her maternity
OL,14,Fleave will replace Griffith as shadow
OL,15,Fbusiness secretary and act as his
OL,16,Fdeputy in the ongoing shake-up.
OL,18,FBadenoch is forming a new shadow
OL,19,Fcabinet before the party's conference
OL,20,Fin October.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
