OL,3,ASouth African airline defends
OL,4,Alow-altitude aerial stunt over packed
OL,5,Astadium
OL,6,
OL,7,FAs videos of Saturday's aerial feat
OL,8,Fwere shared, some labelled the
OL,9,Fstartling manoeuvre reckless, while
OL,10,Fothers have praised the precision and
OL,11,Fexpertise required to pull it off.
OL,13,FIn response, Airlink said it was
OL,14,Fcarefully planned with the support of
OL,15,Fthe aviation authorities.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
